    "type": "game",
    "name": "Jai Kali",
    "steam_appid": 3350610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9031e8d51398c509b8a061f381bdee58.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=800 height=1144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9031e8d51398c509b8a061f381bdee58.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an LVG, a GALGAME, a visual novel. It is the story of the Bharat goddess Jai Kali demonstrating her divine powers on earth, the story of the protagonist from Malayalam, who travels to Lancashire in the north of England to work, but then gets tricked into becoming a Hijra and eventually redeems himself.  This game is developed by an open source engine, all scripts, pictures, videos, music are not encrypted in any way. Amidst struggles and challenges, his path to redemption intertwines with the goddess's powers and purpose. Player can discover a one-of-a-kind narrative that delves into themes of identity, transformation, and the influence of divine power. Whether you are a fan of visual novels or curious about cultural storytelling, this game offers a heartfelt and thought-provoking experience. Immerse yourself in a unique narrative inspired by Bharatiya mythology and cultural themes, offering a blend of drama, emotion, and spirituality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/e0bcfbe7a676f276c379e2d40ab14612.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=800 height=998 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/e0bcfbe7a676f276c379e2d40ab14612.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9245269e26b2846195aab3a05d4bab89.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=462 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9245269e26b2846195aab3a05d4bab89.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9245269e26b2846195aab3a05d4bab89.mp4?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/111211e6a7a216d934580382d9fd08ea.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=457 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/111211e6a7a216d934580382d9fd08ea.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9031e8d51398c509b8a061f381bdee58.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=800 height=1144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9031e8d51398c509b8a061f381bdee58.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an LVG, a GALGAME, a visual novel. It is the story of the Bharat goddess Jai Kali demonstrating her divine powers on earth, the story of the protagonist from Malayalam, who travels to Lancashire in the north of England to work, but then gets tricked into becoming a Hijra and eventually redeems himself.  This game is developed by an open source engine, all scripts, pictures, videos, music are not encrypted in any way. Amidst struggles and challenges, his path to redemption intertwines with the goddess's powers and purpose. Player can discover a one-of-a-kind narrative that delves into themes of identity, transformation, and the influence of divine power. Whether you are a fan of visual novels or curious about cultural storytelling, this game offers a heartfelt and thought-provoking experience. Immerse yourself in a unique narrative inspired by Bharatiya mythology and cultural themes, offering a blend of drama, emotion, and spirituality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/e0bcfbe7a676f276c379e2d40ab14612.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=800 height=998 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/e0bcfbe7a676f276c379e2d40ab14612.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9245269e26b2846195aab3a05d4bab89.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=462 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9245269e26b2846195aab3a05d4bab89.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/9245269e26b2846195aab3a05d4bab89.mp4?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/111211e6a7a216d934580382d9fd08ea.poster.avif?t=1736138816\" width=457 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350610/extras/111211e6a7a216d934580382d9fd08ea.webm?t=1736138816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
